Q: How to document static class properties in PHP A: <p>That usefull if many classes extends some properties/methods/magics</p>
<pre class="lang-php prettyprint-override"><code>class Foo
{
    /**
     * @var FooApp
     */
    public static $app;
}

/**
 * @mixin PhpDocsBar
 */
class Bar extends Foo
{ }


class PhpDocsBar
{
    /** @var BarApp */
    public static $app;
}
</code></pre>
<p>From that:
<a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/37554329/how-to-deprecate-a-magic-property-in-phpdoc">How to deprecate a magic property in PHPDoc?</a></p>
